{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1963e688c519f838ccd8b9345dd33cb6bb414d3d1a2c5fc42dc5da8390f78a5e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_057cb5625af47b557fb2958825c526f9257e3ef9f1422fb5ca7f8fca391a620a","slc_842ed85022594826bbfb0fc20a7e2ce992a7365bcd771454d9029aaffcd7ff92","slc_e2002a9a7c23947b1ae6430c6f3ee7ecfec6bdd27f8e4ede37fcc68e5a46dc9a"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"A `task` tool delegates work to subagents that run independently without user interaction; a built-in read-only `explore` subagent exists, and custom subagents are defined with agent_type = \"subagent\".","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3479157b9b2836b228dd7bf7d6e30d649b1eb009c98b4a1ee1eecdd17327de27","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e7ea9c423e3f289a4d8894151dff1366db0f95e94299cb65b514b212dab41ad","slc_21a788a662641a6f77d6f12ce24ea6ff3993601dc1c7611757c6e5850921172a"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Mistral Vibe is a command-line coding assistant powered by Mistral's models, providing a conversational interface to explore, modify, and interact with codebases using natural language.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7136e8f77fcbfe620394b78fd3dd98b77d9aee993a6ee5973b10105280f810ba","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ad24a194bc7f55412eff28f1ff17ffd08c8d5d870f1ada4b2b4a5fb9e1ab77ff","slc_deb3ffec783cf16661373404c39fac78a5b58327318d79ec3b6e25f60af2999e","slc_f14f4152394704fe1294019843b888cfe71a456422b94c4721cad4ce11a5d82c"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Tool availability is configurable via enabled_tools and disabled_tools, supporting exact names, glob patterns, and regex (re: prefix); enabled_tools narrows the set first, then disabled_tools removes matching tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_839eb591feec058d5b3ce4c0633c38ea5c10159e6cd492489eb6b1116be63b31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8492604c95c6127b016093c1a436f7c8a633b5f1a37c85fcca1e81ec5489c4b8"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Programmatic mode accepts options including --max-turns, --max-price, --max-tokens, --agent, --auto-approve/--yolo, --enabled-tools/--disabled-tools, and --output with text, json, or streaming formats.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9b4c72e1fbce1338457beebcbcf0686cf10c4a41199a1f7bdfe2d019976334d6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4454e0dfa6ac5a828965a4ed510137e1c876e8e4c216e6b0ec4e611b8d078353","slc_6a58b77911dcbab1689bb56b999d91e0ed0d1d05b199954dcfa28a53c04f3358","slc_cef2ec31426f21058695a89f57ca81bb1b4dd926870d0be0a9be6eee052d9056"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Voice mode is documented as experimental and may change in future releases; it is toggled with the /voice slash command and recording starts via Ctrl+R.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b260c0ae2c87d6ed6699f8d67ad4bd780c857f156edacc1c832de0e4ba5749f8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38598682e7aa16fe00b450a07b88d5e60ea64aaa997b7ad7b7bf7d5b00867ebd"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Vibe ships built-in agent profiles governing tool approval: ask (approval required), plan (read-only, auto-approves safe tools), accept-edits (default, auto-approves file edits), and auto-approve (approves all tool executions).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_be58a10711a10a10e3225be11b34fd73012a878ca04c7c179deae9327a320f11","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2324105abfc7c3041eebc1ecf45a4e6e1c724a937c22d997b8619a6372bae5bf","slc_4a308cf6d870aca38d0166eff2e54bbcdc06c13272498292b1da994d9af83b6d","slc_bffaff4516ba80ca2992218d7bf8f05237e8d937d6fcd16caf159db99cefa9c1"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Vibe supports MCP server configuration under mcp_servers, with a `vibe mcp add` command supporting streamable-http transport, static auth via --api-key-env or --header, and OAuth browser login by default otherwise.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c376a6061f915170f92704e0d1cd4c4cf9393e7f176f62c579ffc94110f4e3a6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a264e1aa187449b9b4872d483c9c7bcf2749118e75bfb94769d94b107284ac1d","slc_abfa4c70eeafa7003381f581db1534ea05ca0599fbad9eade500b83bcf56cf0d","slc_c2df81a3a372e53920924e2b64530aaff2866139f8d8e1f3466aca9b5bf9fd12","slc_e49169d871f920fd526377d53116b5d90abb62b1eb983323fd77e8c8ae379a64"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Vibe includes a trust folder system: directories containing a .vibe subfolder may prompt for trust confirmation, trusted folders are remembered in ~/.vibe/trusted_folders.toml, and AGENTS.md instructions and project-local skills load only for trusted folders.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c4b898a11cae93255c053cc1b6a8477d57be6ae57904ff2f217c58b61979b3b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3a64aa3892c7e0ae93dc10c31a77aa46f380d6a0aecf4ab1c33785e51364f1ba","slc_7d88e653a4938db83afcc707d693aaca3cba235f77d1c3789d9f91be0da4bd31","slc_a5e9b8c82b05b29431a520605b670c81e7bcc58189c1d73b4fc7f16165bb57ec","slc_e49169d871f920fd526377d53116b5d90abb62b1eb983323fd77e8c8ae379a64"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Skills are directories with a SKILL.md using YAML frontmatter, following the Agent Skills specification; they can add tools, slash commands, and behaviors, and are discovered from config skill_paths, .agents/skills/, .vibe/skills/, and ~/.vibe/skills/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c65253ae44b97c2ebbf5f644461470016f5fdb54061efa16444e40a9e85ca89e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_161bcd7a22806c56a3421c737d2ce81d81370c0e34349a66bc4df290a4397000","slc_bc15f2bb78a148525a36466447bcfa14f157cc8d7dcc844ce5ebfd187ed3068d"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Compaction uses a built-in prompt at prompts/compact.md by default, keeps the same session and visible conversation, and later model requests use the compacted context followed by newer messages; custom compaction prompts are supported.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c829feb7add145ddefa07733195838ef9a32c93d5391eee4c95f2cd79ac6785c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0de70ed4fda639ae9b5fe368196fcba34bf45c0f77a1ee7df9ae8687be9756d5","slc_17c94bbd4be9c83692dd8a742692cbaac4258db2c9aa61c37b3fa558e5501cd6","slc_c43fc66fd3cbc10cd9fb799434557d4e3f403f0076920fca810ab990dcf30d3c","slc_ee6a5903387cb58b19e30b0ec2aba899f7d1d0c3eb245cdadc5dc82cb99960aa"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"The package is published on PyPI as mistral-vibe and targets Python 3.12+; installation is via a curl install script, `uv tool install mistral-vibe`, or pip.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ce6cca88bfe85ad6d7aae3b72071a79425efeaac588c26030a6e2a350cb3d892","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e6ee6a4b755db763b861e0897e77ccb851ff5b731f71308ff956335269500f7","slc_23ecfb88ea4e4082eeb6107cf7705cd6f62bf6a8116c52fe0d0bc2b9002c9078","slc_25b1de17ec6f053a261e7526dd2653e9e19d6eabc6b8b5e1b64d5f3adf784ebe"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"Built-in tools include read, write_file, edit, grep (with ripgrep support), todo list management, ask_user_question, and task delegation; shell tools exist in a legacy one-shot bash variant and a managed variant with session, stdin, and log-file tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d8c413536c4feff1e58772c45df404da851ca2798c164c60f450eae9b1455fb8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"mistralai/mistral-vibe@d4b3223bbd74 snapshot da3e2ef6099117de","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2505dd0fb7e6649df4bcfb6e6a4134b4d00e5c28ec8b89f1228fb3e79c77ab75","slc_4e2bbb12e0d679aa61fece78a55b0d90cadb92b0eec852618f168fd437a6432a","slc_65c62a322b37b37080688706e4ac2d87b9ca17007b89c2b72ebeba2974d9f05c","slc_e5401c054a929a5b4142330769163c936d9bba5ce22031b9c6a03d5665ae037d"],"source_ids":["src_da2c6401dc795aa38567aa61e36a00dd"],"text":"The CLI offers interactive chat via `vibe`, a one-shot prompt argument, and non-interactive programmatic mode through `--prompt` or piped input for scripting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:20:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ba68c74c23694eaa8552481130ee8ac4"}
